msgstr "Result boundary"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "平台软件"
msgstr "Platform software"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "真实生产 C 路径、模型、ARM ELF、资源预算和 fresh tests"
msgstr ""
"Actual production C paths, models, ARM ELFs, resource budgets and fresh "
"tests"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "每项绑定实际源码、配置和工具；dirty workspace 只作开发记录"
msgstr ""
"Each result binds actual source, configuration and tools; a dirty workspace "
"provides development records only"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "源码 SDK"
msgstr "Source SDK"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "clean HEAD、锁定依赖、许可 manifest、独立 consumer"
msgstr ""
"Clean HEAD, locked dependencies, license manifest and independent consumers"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "从当前新包实际 configure/build/run/link，核对完整文件映射"
msgstr ""
"Actually configure, build, run or link from the newly exported package and "
"verify the complete file map"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "文档"
msgstr "Documentation"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "当前正文、已审翻译、架构图、锁定工具和严格双语构建"
msgstr ""
"Current prose, reviewed translations, architecture diagrams, locked tools "
"and strict bilingual builds"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "只建立文档构建结果，不建立部署或固件资格"
msgstr ""
"Establishes documentation build results only, without deployment or firmware"
" qualification"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "物理 HIL"
msgstr "Physical HIL"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "实际 PCB/UID/probe/serial/power/station、同一 image 与预算"
msgstr ""
"Actual PCB, UID, probe, serial, power and station, with the same image and "
"budget"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "当前硬件未接入，MCU 目标保持 `not_executed`"
msgstr "Equipment is not connected; MCU targets remain `not_executed`"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:13
msgid ""
"原始命令、报告与产物保存在构建输出或外部交付位置，PR 链接准确源码与实际执行范围。 "
"当前仓库不再维护候选封存、promotion、归档恢复或隔离复现引擎；历史流程从固定源码追溯。"
msgstr ""
"Keep original commands, reports and artifacts in build outputs or an "
"external delivery location; the PR links exact source and actual execution "
"scope. This repository no longer maintains candidate sealing, promotion, "
"archive recovery or isolated reproduction engines; historical workflows "
"remain traceable through fixed source revisions."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:16
msgid ""
"HIL fixture 和 station template 位于 `tools/hil/fixtures/`。空 station、错误 "
"Board/PCB/芯片／probe／image/config、失效工具文件或不完整预算会被准入拒绝。 "
"准备工装不等于已经刷写、串口测试、测量波形或完成掉电试验。"
msgstr ""
"HIL fixtures and station templates are in `tools/hil/fixtures/`. Admission "
"rejects empty stations, incorrect Board/PCB/chip/probe/image/config, invalid"
" tool files or incomplete budgets. Preparing fixtures is not flashing, "
"serial testing, waveform measurement or completed power-cut testing."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:25
msgid ""
"USB 的 packet/clock/factory 模型与软件 Board ELF 不提供 VBUS、connector、PHY、 "
"enumeration 或 flush 周期的物理证明。浅 Sleep 的 1 MHz timer 模型只建立被执行 的量化相位合同，真实 "
"clock/PLL/wake/IRQ/catch-up/功耗要用同一镜像测量。Ethernet descriptor "
"OWN/loan、capture/break 与 caller memory pin 的软件模型同样不能 建立电气、吞吐、边沿孔径、功率级安全或 "
"MPU/TZ userspace 隔离。公共 API、模式 配置、SoC provider、reviewed Board "
"route、最终候选与物理执行是不同退出条件。"
msgstr ""
"USB packet/clock/factory models and software-Board ELFs do not physically "
"prove VBUS, connector, PHY, enumeration or flush cycles. The shallow-Sleep 1"
" MHz timer model establishes only the executed quantization-phase contract; "
"actual clock/PLL/wake/IRQ/catch-up/power require measurement on the same "
"image. Ethernet descriptor OWN/loan, capture/break and caller-memory-pin "
"software models likewise establish no electrical, throughput, edge-aperture,"
" power-stage safety or MPU/TZ userspace isolation. Public API, mode "
"configuration, SoC provider, reviewed Board route, final candidate and "
"physical execution have different exit conditions."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:32
msgid ""
"可返回任务只有真实 kernel detach 后才归还存储；prestart discard 只属于已证明 的启动前 scope。scheduler "
"启动尝试后返回是 retaining fail-stop，不能将内核 返回值解释为从未启动，或撤销可能已经运行的任务、DMA、时钟和外部效果。 停止 "
"I/O 后仍运行的内核继续保留 clock/Tick；产品 reset、设备 safe outputs 和 完整 scheduler-stop port"
" 是外部责任。平台不做自动故障恢复或安全认证声明。"
msgstr ""
"Returning tasks release storage only after actual kernel detach. Prestart "
"discard applies only to proven prestart scope. A scheduler-start attempt "
"that returns is a retaining fail-stop; kernel return cannot mean never "
"started or revoke tasks, DMA, clocks and external effects that may have run."
" A kernel still running after I/O stop retains clock/Tick. Product reset, "
"safe device outputs and a complete scheduler-stop port are external "
"responsibilities. The platform claims no automatic fault recovery or safety "
"certification."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:38
msgid ""
"Core 的 `nx_fault_observe` 是无默认状态的 best-effort 观察窄端口。FreeRTOS 和 ThreadX 在 "
"retaining fail-stop 路径提供实际 domain/reason/静态源码位置，然后仍 保留全部借用。故障上下文可能已 "
"masked、ISR、unprivileged 或 stack 损坏，观察者 不能假定工作中的 "
"kernel/clock/transport，也不能释放借用、加 OS lock 或重放 请求。hook 返回仍继续停机；fault log、外部 "
"safe output 与受控 reset 分别验收， 不能由 host death test 推断实板异常处理和安全输出已经运行。"
msgstr ""
"Core `nx_fault_observe` is a best-effort observation narrow port with no "
"default state. FreeRTOS/ThreadX retaining fail-stop paths supply actual "
"domain/reason/static source position and retain all borrows. Fault context "
"may be masked, ISR, unprivileged or stack-corrupted. Observers cannot assume"
" a working kernel/clock/transport, release borrows, take OS locks or replay "
"requests. Returning hooks still proceed with halt. Fault logging, external "
"safe output and controlled reset are separately accepted; host death tests "
"do not imply executed physical exception handling or safe outputs."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:45
msgid ""
"验证记录应保留原始命令、退出码、JUnit、模型、预算与 binary 身份。源码或产物 变化后重新执行适用检查，文档更新不继承历史资格。CI 与 "
"SDK 消费也不自动完成 产品发布。"
msgstr ""
"Validation records retain original commands, exit codes, JUnit, models, "
"budgets and binary identities. Re-execute applicable checks after source or "
"artifact changes; documentation updates do not inherit historical "
"qualification. CI and SDK consumption do not automatically perform a product"
" release."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:49
msgid ""
"实板接入后优先复核安全输出、clock/reset、UART TC/cancel/RX loss、SPI/I2C、Flash "
"掉电、watchdog、EXTI/PWM/ADC，再测 cycles/latency/high-water 与长期负载。私有 "
"产品策略、现场部署、密钥与制造许可由外部工程承接。"
msgstr ""
"After hardware connection, first check safe outputs, clock/reset, UART "
"TC/cancel/RX loss, SPI/I2C, Flash power cuts, watchdog and EXTI/PWM/ADC; "
"then measure cycles/latency/high-water and sustained load. External projects"
" own private product policies, field deployment, keys and manufacturing "
"permissions."

msgid "当前生产 SoC 只维护 F4，精确器件与模式见[支持范围](support.md)。F407 Board 与 新增料号的内部 CRC 软件参考分别记录，不把某一参考的 ARM／SDK 结果扩展到全部 模式。其他系列原始记录保留原源码身份。ThreadX、FreeRTOS、Native、寄存器模型、 ARM 链接与物理执行分别判断，链接程序不证明 scheduler 已运行；本轮结果不继承历史计数。"
msgstr "F4 is the only production SoC scope; see [support scope](support.md) for exact devices and modes. F407 Boards and internal-CRC software references for added parts are recorded separately; ARM/SDK evidence for one reference does not extend to every mode. Records for other series retain their original source identity. ThreadX, FreeRTOS, Native, register models, ARM linkage and physical execution are assessed separately. A linked program does not prove scheduler execution, and current results inherit no historical counts."

msgid "本批声明式接入的软件记录"
msgstr "Software records for this declarative integration batch"

msgid "本批实际结果由 [PR #64](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/64)导航。各记录保留实际源码、配置、检查器和原始命令；后续工具或文档变更不把原执行重标为新提交重新执行。"
msgstr "[PR #64](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/64) indexes actual results for this batch. Each record retains its actual source, configuration, checker and original commands; later tool or documentation changes do not relabel an earlier execution as a rerun on a new commit."

msgid "[`f53e767`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/f53e76784c0bf6d4fc9a876322372dbda6ea04d2) 的安装 SDK 消费记录覆盖 51 个维护消费者；同一计划覆盖八个精确料号、七个器件视图。模型运行、ARM 链接、资源预算与检查器修正分别保留适用范围，不推导全部 F4 硬件模式或 scheduler 的物理执行。"
msgstr "The installed-SDK consumer records for [`f53e767`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/f53e76784c0bf6d4fc9a876322372dbda6ea04d2) cover 51 maintained consumers. The same plan covers eight exact parts and seven device views. Model execution, ARM linking, resource budgets and checker corrections retain their respective scopes; they do not establish every F4 hardware mode or physical scheduler execution."

msgid "[`f53e767`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/f53e76784c0bf6d4fc9a876322372dbda6ea04d2) 的独立 GD32F470 GPIO／UART 软件参考完成 26 项 GoogleTest、四项供应负例和两组 ARM 镜像与预算。原始供应锁、逐文件内容、CMSIS pin 和安装路径分别核对；参考不进入生产家族或默认 SDK，物理 HIL 保持 `not_executed`。"
msgstr "The independent GD32F470 GPIO/UART software reference for [`f53e767`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/f53e76784c0bf6d4fc9a876322372dbda6ea04d2) completed 26 GoogleTests, four supplier-rejection tests and two ARM images with budget checks. Original supplier locks, file bytes, the CMSIS pin and installed paths were checked separately. The reference does not enter production-family support or the default SDK; physical HIL remains `not_executed`."

msgid "USB 的既有 PR 合并镜像保留 `b9ab867e7ed70df06d86377a295af78bc571e518` 来源，其源树与 `f53e767` 相同。新检查器对原始 ELF、bindings 与 resolved 输入独立复验；没有重建镜像，也没有将结果改记为最终工具提交的执行。"
msgstr "The existing USB PR-merge image retains its source identity, `b9ab867e7ed70df06d86377a295af78bc571e518`, whose source tree equals `f53e767`. The new checker independently rechecks the original ELF, bindings and resolved inputs; the image is not rebuilt and the result is not relabelled as execution on the final tool commit."

msgid "最终工具提交 [`f3433f6`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/f3433f67ea891f45a3c7be672235532723e40677) 修正静态声明的 retention 检查与文档测试的 SDK 选择调用，真实失败和成功记录分别保留。新检查器对原消费者的适用检查重新执行，原 Native 程序和不要求 retention 的 ARM 产物按各自退出条件复核，没有重新编译；这不等于重新构建全部消费者。最终 SDK 从该干净提交重新导出并验证，前述产物仍保留原始执行身份。"
msgstr "The final tool commit [`f3433f6`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/f3433f67ea891f45a3c7be672235532723e40677) corrects retention checks for static declarations and the SDK-selection call in documentation tests, retaining actual failure and success records separately. Applicable checks are rerun against the original consumers; original Native programs and ARM artifacts that do not require retention are reassessed against their own exit conditions without recompilation. This is not a rebuild of all consumers. The final SDK is exported and verified again from that clean commit, while the artifacts above retain their original execution identities."

msgid "外部示例独立验收，私有记录不随公共平台发布。"
msgstr "External examples undergo independent acceptance; private records are not published with the public platform."

msgid "前序便携 I/O 的结果入口为 [PR #62](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/62)。 平台实现 `6b59f666` 的四种 Native 模式分别完成完整执行；最终 `4bf4b5a2` 仅修正 SDK 参考调用者，并在 clean source 上完成 34 个消费者及搬移前后完整性验证。 原始失败和后续成功记录分别保留，完整 SDK 通过不把先前失败改为成功。静态分析 保留完整扫描及唯一受影响上下文的修正重验；文档与 ARM 参考构建保留各自实际输入， 不将它们改写为最终提交重新执行。后续文档和测试夹具修正须在同一 PR 保留各自 适用检查、合并源码及 SDK 身份，旧记录仍适用于原提交。"
msgstr "[PR #62](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/62) is the results entry point for the preceding portable I/O iteration. The four Native modes for platform implementation `6b59f666` each completed their full execution; final `4bf4b5a2` only corrected an SDK reference caller and completed 34 consumers and integrity verification before and after relocation on clean source. Original failures and later successes are retained separately; a complete SDK pass does not turn earlier failures into successes. Static analysis retains the full scan and correction/replay of the sole affected context. Documentation and ARM reference builds retain their actual inputs and are not relabeled as new executions at the final commit. Subsequent documentation and test-fixture corrections must retain their own applicable checks, merged source and SDK identities in the same PR; old records continue to apply to their original commits."
